---

This covers the code written for Barfly. Two parts of this repository came
from elsewhere and keep their own terms:

- src/brain/, src/fly3d/ and scripts/build_data.py are from dtecx/doodle-fly
  (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 dtecx). See LICENSE-doodle-fly. The files in
  src/brain/ and src/fly3d/ carry Barfly additions, marked in comments.
- The fly brain data that `npm run data` downloads is the FlyWire v783
  connectome, released under CC BY-NC 4.0: attribution required, no
  commercial use. It is not included in this repository.
